Tandaan ang aking mga salita.

00:24:13.041 --> 00:24:14.321
Nakuha ko.

00:24:16.442 --> 00:24:17.361
Young Master!

00:24:18.601 --> 00:24:20.001
Hintayin mo ako, Young Master!

