00:27:24.482 --> 00:27:25.561
Hayaan mong tulungan kita.

00:27:25.682 --> 00:27:27.081
Aayusin kita.

00:27:27.081 --> 00:27:28.081
Sapat na.

00:27:29.321 --> 00:27:30.122
Ikaw bigla

00:27:30.122 --> 00:27:31.761
