00:27:34.642 --> 00:27:37.041
Hindi ko talaga sinasadya.

00:27:41.041 --> 00:27:41.841
Huan Zong.

00:27:42.001 --> 00:27:43.162
Hindi naisip

00:27:43.242 --> 00:27:44.361
magkikita kami ulit

00:27:44.361 --> 00:27:46.521
