00:30:52.001 --> 00:30:53.081
Ang bobo kong alaala...

00:30:53.442 --> 00:30:55.521
Siguradong mawawala na naman ako sa kanya.

00:31:01.801 --> 00:31:04.242
Malapit nang bumalik si Lord.

00:31:04.321 --> 00:31:06.281
Kung ihahanda natin ang elixir

00:31:06.482 --> 00:31:08.001
