Ang aming mga suite ay

00:31:39.642 --> 00:31:40.882
sa dalawang palapag na ito.

00:31:43.321 --> 00:31:45.521
Napakalawak na patyo.

00:31:48.041 --> 00:31:49.442
Sa ganitong paraan, pakiusap.

00:31:51.642 --> 00:31:53.761
Kung kailangan mo ng isang elixir chamber

00:31:53.841 --> 00:31:55.722
o pribadong patyo,

00:31:55.962 --> 00:31:57.162
