00:32:03.122 --> 00:32:04.962
Bakit mag-isa ang paglalakbay?

00:32:05.162 --> 00:32:06.642
Nang walang katulong?

00:32:07.361 --> 00:32:08.521
Paglilinang

00:32:08.521 --> 00:32:09.882
ay hindi tungkol sa pagpapakitang gilas.

00:32:10.202 --> 00:32:11.081
Hindi na kailangan

00:32:11.081 --> 00:32:12.321
upang magkalat ng mga bulaklak

00:32:12.482 --> 00:32:13.801
tulad ng ilang mga grand opera.

00:32:13.801 --> 00:32:14.301
Well...

00:32:18.402 --> 00:32:19.001
Tingnan mo!

00:32:22.490 --> 00:32:25.088
(Walang katapusang Bisita)

00:32:30.234 --> 00:32:32.024
